msgstr "Lapai nav derīga MediaBox"

msgid "The page is a transparency group"
msgstr "Lapa ir caurspīdīguma grupa"

msgid "The page was read again; its words were replaced (undo in the panel)"
msgstr "Lapa nolasīta no jauna; tās vārdi aizstāti (atsaukt panelī)"

